Maintainer: Gaetano Romano <g.romano@lancaster.ac.uk>
Description: This is a package for high-performance online changepoint detection in univariate and multivariate data streams. 
             It provides efficient C++ implementations of the FOCUS, MD-FOCUS and NP-FOCUS algorithms, with R and Python 
             interfaces for real-time monitoring and offline analysis.
             The package bundles code from code from Qhull <http://www.qhull.org/>, from C.B. Barber and The Geometry Center. 
             See inst/COPYRIGHTS for details.
